  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rajaram Madhukar Khade vs The State Of Maharashtra on 30 November, 2021 Author: V. G. Bisht Bench: V. G. Bisht 13-aba-2837-2021. In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Rekha Prakash Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Patil Anticipatory Bail Application No. 2837 Of 2021 Digitally signed by Rekha Prakash Patil Date: 2021.11.30 18:18:07 +0530 Rajaram Madhukar Khade ... Applica Versus The State of Maharashtra ... Respond Mr. Ganesh Bhujbal, for the Applicant.",
    "facts": "It appears that the applicant was found in possession of ra material and other material used in manufacturing country liquor. 5. The learned APP states that the Analyst had found that the milk was containing Non Food Grade Paraffin, which is in breach of the Provisions of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and Food Safety and Standards (Food Products Standards and Food Additives) Regulations, 2011.",
    "arguments": "4. The learned counsel for the Applicant points out that after the receipt of the report of the Analyst a Statutory Appeal has been filed before the Co-Commissioner of Food and Drugs Administration, Pune, which is pending.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "4. The learned counsel for the Applicant points out that after the receipt of the report of the Analyst a Statutory Appeal has been filed before the Co-Commissioner of Food and Drugs Administration, Pune, which is pending.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
